  "unitName": "0. First Signal",
  "unitDescription": "Begin your first authorized security case with Ed at CyberQuest Academy. Investigate a warning on the Training Northstar portal, connect evidence from mail, websites, commands, and tools, and decide how to turn your findings into action as a Whitehat Hacker or Hacktivist.",
  "defaultPlayerName": "Alex",
  "unitEntryMessage": "Welcome to CyberQuest Academy, {player}. Training Northstar needs help reviewing a warning on its service portal. Ed has the authorization and your first lead. Check his briefing, establish the scope, and build a record the client can act on.",
